<view class="page account-page"><view class="page-header"><text class="eyebrow">学习记录</text><text class="page-title">每一步，都有迹可循</text><text class="page-subtitle">浏览过的内容随时可以重学，已浏览不代表已掌握。</text></view><block wx:if="{{recent.length}}"><view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">最近学习</text><text class="section-note">最近 3 组</text></view><view class="stack"><ui-entry wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="key" title="{{item.topicName + ' · ' + item.setName}}" description="{{item.title + ' · 第 ' + (item.currentIndex + 1) + ' / ' + item.count + ' 条'}}" data-index="{{index}}" bind:activate="onRecent" /></view><view class="section"><text class="section-title">各专项浏览进度</text><view class="stack section"><ui-entry wx:for="{{topics}}" wx:key="id" title="{{item.name}}" meta="{{item.meta}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:activate="onTopic" /></view></view></block><ui-state wx:else title="从第一条开始积累" description="学习后，这里会显示最近的分组与浏览进度。" action="开始学习" bind:action="onStart" /></view>
